#| msgid "In this module you can change &kde; default components."
msgid "In this module, you can change &kde; default components."
msgstr "Neste módulo pode cambiar os compoñentes predeterminados de &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: index.docbook:30
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Components are programs that handle basic tasks, like the terminal emulator, the text editor and the email client. Different &kde; applications sometimes need to invoke a console emulator, send a mail or display some text."
msgid "Components are programs that handle basic tasks, like the web browser, terminal emulator, the file manager, the email client, the electronic map, and the dialer. Different &kde; applications sometimes need to invoke a console emulator, send an email, manage files and folders, show the map or dial a number on your phone."
msgstr "As compoñentes son programas que xestionan tarefas básicas, como o emulador da terminal, o editor de textos e o cliente do correo electrónico. Algúns aplicativos de &kde; ás veces precisan usar un emulador de consola, enviar un correo ou amosar algún texto."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "To do so consistently, these applications always call the same components. Here you can select which programs these components are."
msgstr "Para facelo dun xeito consistente eses aplicativos sempre usan as mesmas compoñentes. Aquí é onde pode escoller os programas que son esas compoñentes."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
